# M16: a drive that is not ready. Retry tries it again and Cancel stays where it was. Host only: DOSBox cannot make a drive answer
# "not ready", so this one is played on the host and the INT 24h path is left for a machine with a real floppy drive.
@dialog
@dir QUILL
@place Quill C:\QUILL
@cwd C:\DOCS
@dir DOCS
@drive A removable notready
f10 down enter                # File > Open...
altp home enter               # the A: place: the drive is not ready
r                             # Retry: it still is
esc                           # Cancel: the dialog stays where it was
esc                           # leaves the dialog
